\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Biden Nominates Lawyer Who Argued Supreme Court  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Case to Judgeship; \uc2 Julie Rikelman\uc2  will be the 132nd federal judicial nominee for whom the Biden administration has sought Senate confirmation\b0\par\par\uc2 By Jan Wolfe \par \uc2 431 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2022\par 19:15 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14President Biden nominated an attorney who unsuccessfully argued for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the case that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  to a vacancy on a federal appeals court.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden has named \uc2 Julie Rikelman\uc2  to the Boston-based U.S. Court of Appeals for the First Circuit, the White House said Friday. Her appointment is subject to confirmation from a simple majority of the Senate, where she will likely face strong opposition from Republicans.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Rikelman, a lawyer with the \uc2 Center for \b \highlight22\uc2 Reproductive Rights\b0 \highlight\uc2 , argued in front of the Supreme Court last year in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/how-the-supreme-court-overturned-roe-v-wade-and-abortion-rights-11656081705"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization }}}\uc2 , representing the now-closed Mississippi \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic at the center of the case.\par \par \uc2 In that case, a divided Supreme Court ruled there is no federal constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sending the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights back to state legislatures.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden included Ms. Rikelman in an announcement of eight nominations to vacancies on federal courts around the country, which the White House said was Mr. Biden's 24th round of nominees for federal judgeships and his 11th round of nominations so far this year.\par \par \uc2 The White House has faced pressure from progressive activists to move more quickly on judicial nominees. Mr. Biden is expected to have more difficulty getting judicial nominees through Senate confirmation hearings next year if Republicans take back control of the chamber.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden has announced 132 federal judicial nominees so far in his presidency, about 70 of whom have been confirmed by the Senate.\par \par \uc2 The White House made increasing diversity throughout the federal bench a central priority. More than 70% of the lawyers Mr. Biden has nominated to judgeships have been women, and a majority are members of racial minorities.\par \par \uc2 Former President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  had 231 nominees confirmed to federal judgeships over the course of his presidency.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Rikelman joined the Center for \b \highlight22\uc2 Reproductive Rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2011. Before joining the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocacy group she held various in-house counsel jobs at NBCUniversal.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Rikelman's nomination came two weeks after Mr. Biden abandoned a plan {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-abandons-plan-to-name-antiabortion-judge-backed-by-mcconnell-11657942448"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to nominate a conservative antiabortion lawyer }}}\uc2  to a federal judgeship in Kentucky.\par \par \uc2 The White House's plan to nominate Chad Meredith, allegedly as part of an agreement with Senate Minority Leader \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  (R., Ky.), had been met with anger from some Democrats and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocates.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-nominates-lawyer-who-argued-supreme-court-abortion-case-to-judgeship-11659122157"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden Nominates Lawyer Who Argued Supreme Court \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Case to Judgeship }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220729ei7t005xx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
