ate since the decision. Some groups encourage patients in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346?page=1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states that restrict \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  to travel to states where patients can get the pills legally; some organizations help raise money to pay for their travel. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
