\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Biden Signs Executive Order on  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 , Contraception Access; Some Democrats have urged a more robust administration response to the Supreme Court's overturning Roe v. Wade\b0\par\par\uc2 By Tarini Parti and Stephanie Armour \par \uc2 909 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 July 2022\par 17:12 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 President Biden signed an executive order directing agencies to take steps to protect access to abortions and the privacy of patients seeking \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive health\b0 \highlight\uc2  services, following the Supreme Court decision {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Friday's order will direct Secretary of Health and Human Services \uc2 Xavier Becerra\uc2  to submit a report within 30 days on additional action the agency can take to protect and expand access to contraceptives and abortions, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-an-abortion-pill-leaked-supreme-court-decision-11651775689"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  pill }}}\uc2  approved by the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2 , the White House said.\par \par \uc2 The executive order also calls on \uc2 HHS\uc2  to launch a public-education campaign on access to \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive-health\b0 \highlight\uc2  services. It also seeks to bring together pro bono lawyers and public-interest organizations to represent patients and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers on issues such as a helping women {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 travel out of state }}}\uc2  to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We cannot allow an out-of-control Supreme Court working in conjunction with extremist elements of the Republican Party to take away freedoms and our personal autonomy," Mr. Biden said before signing the order.\par \par \uc2 The White House said Mr. Biden will ask the \uc2 Federal Trade Commission\uc2  to consider measures to protect the privacy of those seeking information online about reproductive-healthcare services. The order will also direct \uc2 HHS\uc2  and the White House Gender Policy Council to create a task force that would coordinate interagency efforts on the issue.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court ruling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/roe-v-wade-overturned-supreme-court-11656110804"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturning \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  protections }}}\uc2  two weeks ago led to protests across the country. Democrats, including some Biden administration officials, had been growing frustrated with Mr. Biden for not mounting a more forceful response, as the party works to turn the ruling into a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/democrats-move-abortion-fight-to-midterm-elections-after-supreme-court-ruling-11656098522?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rallying cry ahead of the midterm elections }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Some \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights groups said Friday they still wanted Mr. Biden to do more to protect access to abortions. "We are glad to see the White House start to implement a whole of government approach to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access," said Morgan Hopkins, interim president of All Above All. "But this plan, which the White House committed to months ago, is both late and not enough."\par \par \uc2 NARAL Pro-Choice America\uc2  President Mini Timmaraju said the order was an "important first step in restoring the rights taken from millions of Americans by the Supreme Court."\par \par \uc2 White House aides have cautioned for weeks that although they would be taking some steps, no policies from the executive branch could fill the void left by the court's decision. Mr. Biden's executive order reflects those limitations.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights advocates have pressed the administration to take additional steps including declaring a public-health emergency in relation to maternal mortality, removing remaining \uc2 FDA\uc2  restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, paying for women to travel to have abortions and allowing abortions on federal property even inside states that ban the procedure.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents criticized the order, saying it went too far.\par \par \uc2 "President Biden has once again caved to the extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  lobby, determined to put the full weight of the federal government behind promoting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Marjorie Dannenfelser, president of Susan B. Anthony Pro-Life America.\par \par \uc2 Republican National Committee\uc2  chairwoman \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2  called on antiabortion voters to turn out in the midterm elections, following Mr. Biden's remarks. "These latest actions today only further prove how radical Biden and the Democrats have become. Republicans know life matters, and so does your vote in November."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden last week endorsed making an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-is-filibuster-senate-explained-11656606298?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exception to filibuster rules }}}\uc2  to allow passage of legislation codifying Roe v. Wade, but a day later acknowledged he didn't have enough votes in the evenly divided Senate to enact the rules change. The exception would allow legislation protecting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access to pass the Senate with 51 votes rather than the 60 votes usually required for bills to advance.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Biden has said that voters need to elect more Democrats to the Senate in November, arguing that Republicans would seek to pass nationwide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions if they take control of Congress.\par \par \uc2 "It's my hope and strong belief that women will in fact turnout in record numbers to reclaim the rights that have been taken from them by the court," Mr. Biden reiterated Friday, repeating "vote, vote, vote" at one point.\par \par \uc2 Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , who has been a more vocal advocate of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights since the high court's decision, is scheduled to discuss the issue with state legislators on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The executive order comes after \uc2 HHS\uc2  issued patient privacy guidance in late June outlining the federal protections that cover personal medical information that could be used to probe violations of state antiabortion laws.\par \par \uc2 The administration has also told states not to ban prescriptions for the pills used in medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying the drug has been authorized by the \uc2 FDA\uc2 . Mr. Biden on June 24 directed \uc2 HHS\uc2  to "identify all ways to ensure that mifepristone is as widely accessible as possible in light of the \uc2 FDA\uc2 's determination that the drug is safe and effective\u8212\'20\'14including when prescribed through telehealth and sent by mail."\par \par \uc2 Mr. Becerra has said women will have access to medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cases of rape and incest in states that ban those exceptions.\par \par \uc2 Write to Tarini Parti at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Tarini.Parti@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tarini.Parti@wsj.com }}}\uc2  and Stephanie Armour at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:stephanie.armour@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stephanie.armour@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/biden-to-sign-order-stepping-up-efforts-to-protect-access-to-reproductive-care-11657278000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Biden Signs Executive Order on \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 , Contraception Access }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220708ei78001gu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
