\par\par \uc2 Commentary (U.S.)\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Elizabeth Warren Smears Pro-Life Charities; We tell women the truth:  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  isn't their only option.\b0\par\par\uc2 By Christopher Bell \par \uc2 601 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 July 2022\par 22:16 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Sen. Elizabeth Warren last week called for the federal government to "crack down" on crisis pregnancy centers and maternity homes such as Good Counsel, the one I founded in New Jersey in 1985. In the 37 years I've been working with homeless women, pregnant mothers and babies, I've seen how the media smears the pro-life movement. They say we don't care about women. They say we love children only before they're born and, in Ms. Warren's words, that we "mislead and deceive" women into having babies they don't want. She may believe that, but it isn't true.\par \par \uc2 At Good Counsel, like many similar organizations throughout the country, we take in any pregnant woman in need. Most come from broken or dysfunctional homes and have nowhere else to go. They are welcome to stay with us for a year or longer. During that time, we help them develop child-rearing skills. We also provide budgeting and vocational assistance, nutritional advice and tips for a healthy lifestyle. Many women choose to work or go back to school. Our staff babysits\u8212\'20\'14free of charge\u8212\'20\'14while new moms begin to build a r\u233\'00\'E9sum\u233\'00\'E9. We do everything we can to help connect women to resources and support.\par \par \uc2 It isn't easy. We have a curfew and a policy against alcohol and drug use. But every line is drawn with compassion and mercy.\par \par \uc2 Want to talk about deception? Many of the women who come to us have been told\u8212\'20\'14by doctors, high-school counselors and social-service organizations\u8212\'20\'14that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is their only option. They are told that having a baby means they'll never finish school and won't have a career. None of this is true, but I hear it every day.\par \par \uc2 The hidden reality is that no woman in the U.S. today has to raise a child she conceives. There are safe-haven laws in every state and territory allowing a woman to offer a child anonymously for adoption.\par \par \uc2 At Good Counsel, we also help women living with the pain of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I know of no one in the pro-life movement who would condemn a woman for having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Half the women coming to our facility for help have already had at least one \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . We don't throw stones. Many of our volunteers and counselors know the pain of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  firsthand.\par \par \uc2 Want to talk about misleading? Nothing is more misleading than the claim that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is simply healthcare, that terminating a pregnancy is the key to a happy life free from unwanted burdens. My experience of talking with and helping more than 4,000 women at Good Counsel over almost four decades tells me that the pain of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  can be devastating. Nobody should have to face it alone.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court's decision in Dobbs v. Jackson has brought renewed attention to the work done by maternity homes and crisis pregnancy centers. "Love them both" is not just a sign we carry at the March for Life every year. It's the key to ensuring that frightened and abandoned pregnant women understand that they have options other than \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Ms. Warren is welcome to visit Good Counsel anytime she wants. I think she will see that we don't mislead or deceive anyone. We stick to the truth, delivered with compassion and mercy.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Bell is co-founder and president of Good Counsel Homes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/elizabeth-warren-smears-pro-life-charities-mothers-maternity-homes-children-baby-pregnancy-center-11657053639"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elizabeth Warren Smears Pro-Life Charities}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220705ei75006bt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
