\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Texas' Nearly Century-Old  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Ban in Effect for Now, State's High Court Says; Prohibition from 1925 to stay in force at least temporarily, court rules, with more court proceedings ahead\b0\par\par\uc2 By Brent Kendall \par \uc2 371 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 July 2022\par 16:51 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 A nearly century-old Texas ban on abortions can take effect, at least for now, the state Supreme Court said Friday night.\par \par \uc2 The court's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.documentcloud.org/documents/22077864-22-0527"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one-page order }}}\uc2  blocked a temporary postponement of the ban's enforcement that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers had won from a judge in Houston earlier in the week. The Houston judge said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/state-judges-are-in-spotlight-after-supreme-court-overrules-roe-v-wade-11656444559"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the ban, which dates to 1925 }}}\uc2 , had been previously repealed. The state disagrees.\par \par \uc2 The Texas Supreme Court called for additional legal briefing, while the lower-court judge also has an additional hearing scheduled, so Friday's order isn't the last word in the case.\par \par \uc2 "Our state's pre-Roe statutes banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Texas are 100% good law," state Republican Attorney General \uc2 Ken Paxton{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KenPaxtonTX/status/1543193949808066560?ref_src=twsrc^google|twcamp^serp|twgr^tweet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said Saturday on Twitter }}}\uc2 . "Litigation continues, but I'll keep winning for Texas's unborn babies."\par \par \uc2 "This law from nearly 100 years ago is banning essential health care prematurely, despite clearly being long repealed," said Marc Hearron, senior counsel at the \uc2 Center for \b \highlight22\uc2 Reproductive Rights\b0 \highlight\uc2 , one of the groups suing the state.\par \par \uc2 The fast-moving court proceedings come as states around the country {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are sorting through their \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rules }}}\uc2  after the \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overruled Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  and ended nearly 50 years of constitutional protections for a woman's right to choose an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In light of the Supreme Court's ruling, abortions are now largely unavailable in about a dozen states, either because of new bans or legal uncertainty. Another half dozen or more states could ban or restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming days and weeks.\par \par \uc2 Even before Friday's legal developments in Texas, the state separately {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-law-what-to-know-as-supreme-court-allows-it-to-take-effect-11630606238"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had in place a ban on nearly all abortions }}}\uc2  after six weeks of pregnancy. That law uses a novel enforcement strategy that allows members of the public to file lawsuits seeking damages against \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers and those who assist them.\par \par \uc2 Write to Brent Kendall at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:brent.kendall@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brent.kendall@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-nearly-century-old-abortion-ban-in-effect-for-now-states-high-court-says-11656780694"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Texas' Nearly Century-Old \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Ban in Effect for Now, State's High Court Says }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220702ei72001jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
