\par\par \uc2 Infogrfx Slide Show\par \uc2 Interactives\par \b \uc2 Supreme Court  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Decision Draws Reactions Nationwide; Ruling overturning Roe v. Wade sparks widespread gatherings of  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2 -rights and antiabortion campaigners\b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 June 2022\par 03:39 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court Overturns Roe v. Wade}}}\par \par \uc2 Protesters attended a candlelight vigil Sunday in front of the Supreme Court in Washington to denounce the court's decision that overturned Roe v Wade.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights protesters outside the Supreme Court in Washington on Sunday. The court's decision eliminated the constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and broadly returned the issue to the states.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights supporters marched in the New York City Pride parade on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 An \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights activist chanted in front of the Supreme Court in Washington as protests continued across the nation.\par \par \uc2 Protesters converged in Sacramento, Calif., and in cities across the U.S.\par \par \uc2 There was a stream of demonstrators at the Supreme Court in Washington, including \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents who were celebrating their victory.\par \par \uc2 Demonstrators gathered outside the Jackson Women's Health Organization clinic in Jackson, Miss., on Saturday. The high court upheld a law from Mississippi that bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks.\par \par \uc2 A mother hugged her daughter as protesters gathered outside City Hall in San Francisco.\par \par \uc2 A group of antiabortion activists prayed outside the Riverside Superior Court in California during a rally to celebrate the Supreme Court's decision.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights protesters gathered at the Utah State Capitol in Salt Lake City on Friday.\par \par \uc2 An \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights demonstrator in Houston wore a birth-control pill packet as an earring at a protest outside the federal courthouse on Friday.\par \par \uc2 In Phoenix on Friday night, state troopers used tear gas to disperse groups of protesters outside the State Capitol Complex.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-abortion-decision-draws-reactions-nationwide-11656160047"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Decision Draws Reactions Nationwide}}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220625ei6p001b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
