\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Supreme Court's Roe v. Wade Ruling Sets Off Protests as States Plan Moves; Demonstrations continue across the country as high court's decision ends nearly 50 years of constitutional protection for  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto, Ginger Adams Otis and Jennifer Calfas \par \uc2 881 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2022\par 01:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Protests and rallies continued Saturday in response to the Supreme Court's ruling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ended constitutional protections  }}}\uc2  for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, as states continue to adjust to a decision that overturned {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/supreme-court-decision-roe-v-wade-6-24-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearly 50 years of law  }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-courts-roe-v-wade-ruling-sets-off-protests-as-states-plan-next-moves-11656149401?mod=livecoverage_web"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 -rights demonstrators  }}}\uc2  have converged in cities across the U.S. since Friday's decision. Demonstrations took place from Los Angeles to Philadelphia on Saturday, following protests Friday from Washington Square Park in New York City to Cedar Rapids, Iowa, and Albuquerque, N.M.\par \par \uc2 In Indianapolis, hundreds of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights supporters gathered outside the Indiana Statehouse, chanting and waving signs. "The 1950s called. They want their oppression back," said one sign. A group of antiabortion supporters stood nearby and cheered the overturning of Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 There was a stream of demonstrators at the Supreme Court in Washington, including \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents who took pictures in front of the court celebrating their victory. "Into the ash heap of history where you belong, Roe v. Wade," read one sign.\par \par \uc2 In Phoenix on Friday night, state troopers used tear gas to disperse groups of protesters outside the State Capitol Complex. The \uc2 Arizona Department of Public Safety\uc2  said 7,000 to 8,000 people came to the area after the ruling, and what started as a peaceful demonstration changed when groups splintered off and attempted to force their way into the state Senate building.\par \par \uc2 Arizona Sen. Nancy Barto, a Republican, said legislators were finishing up their last day of the session when protesters started banging on the windows and the doors to the lobby. Police ushered them into the basement. "I have never had an end of session like that in all of my years serving in the State Legislature," she said.\par \par \uc2 Department spokesman Bart Graves said there were no arrests in the incident, but six people were arrested in Tucson after they refused to disperse after a crowd of 500 attempted to take over Interstate 10.\par \par \uc2 Students for Life of America said it was organizing antiabortion rallies in front of state capitol buildings on Saturday in more than 30 states, including Georgia and Kansas, where the future of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is uncertain.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/roe-v-wade-overturned-supreme-court-11656110804"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court's ruling  }}}\uc2 , in a case from Mississippi, overturned Roe, the 1973 decision that established a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-does-overturning-roe-v-wade-mean-explained-11656081705"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 constitutional right to an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 . The court, in a decision written by Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  and joined by four other justices, concluded that Roe was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/key-excerpts-from-supreme-courts-abortion-ruling-overturning-roe-v-wade-11656092052"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 egregiously wrong  }}}\uc2  and said there was no provision in the Constitution that implicitly protected the right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The decision upheld a Mississippi ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 15 weeks of pregnancy but more broadly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-courts-abortion-decision-sparks-immediate-action-from-states-11656096002"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returned the issue  }}}\uc2  to the 50 states, which now have broad latitude to prohibit or protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they see fit. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roughly half the states  }}}\uc2  are poised to ban many or most abortions.\par \par \uc2 State \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws evolved almost by the hour. On Saturday in Minnesota, Gov. \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  signed an executive order that aims to provide legal protections to patients who travel there from another state.\par \par \uc2 "Your reproductive freedom will remain protected in Minnesota as long as I am in office," Mr. Walz said on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 On Friday evening, the Utah State Legislature released a statement saying its general counsel had determined that the state law triggering a ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  post-Roe is now in effect. The law, passed in 2020, bans all abortions except in the case of rape, incest or a medical emergency.\par \par \uc2 Planned Parenthood Association of Utah filed a lawsuit Saturday challenging the law in state court.\par \par \uc2 A federal district judge in Alabama lifted an injunction against enforcement of a 2019 state law that made it a felony punishable by up to 99 years in prison to perform an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  except to protect the mother from a serious health risk.\par \par \uc2 "Here in Alabama, we have been preparing for this day when the decision-making authority on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is rightfully returned to the states," Gov. \uc2 Kay Ivey\uc2  , a Republican, said of the law on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 Where \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Is Legal and Where It Loses Protections Without Roe v. Wade\par \par \uc2 Clinics in several states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/fall-of-roe-v-wade-upends-abortion-landscape-for-american-women-11656081225"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closed or suspended service  }}}\uc2  after the decision, though others said they were staying open, at least for now.\par \par \uc2 "We are providing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care right now, just like the past 46 years, and intend to continue," said Kwajelyn Jackson, executive director of Feminist Women's Health Center in Georgia. The state is looking to revive a six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban that was previously blocked in court.\par \par \uc2 "This opinion is making pregnancy more dangerous in this country, not only by forcing unsafe and unplanned pregnancies to continue against one's will, but by further criminalizing pregnancy outcomes," Ms. Jackson said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:laura.kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 laura.kusisto@wsj.com  }}}\uc2 , Ginger Adams Otis at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Ginger.AdamsOtis@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ginger.AdamsOtis@wsj.com  }}}\uc2  and Jennifer Calfas at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:Jennifer.Calfas@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jennifer.Calfas@wsj.com  }}}\uc2  and Jennifer Calfas at\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 How will the Supreme Court's \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ruling affect you? Join the conversation below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-courts-roe-v-wade-ruling-sets-off-protests-as-states-plan-next-moves-11656149401"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supreme Court's Roe v. Wade Ruling Sets Off Protests as States Plan Moves  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220625ei6p000m9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
