\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Fall of Roe v. Wade Upends  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Landscape for American Women; Clinics will close and telemedicine abortions could expand as half of U.S. states are expected to ban or restrict the procedure\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto, Jennifer Calfas, Dominique Mosbergen and Deanna Paul \par \uc2 1,889 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2022\par 21:23 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The fall of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-eliminates-constitutional-right-to-abortion-11656080124"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2  will upend a half-century of reproductive healthcare across the U.S., changing where and how women access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and their decisions about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/agencies-researchers-expect-rise-in-infant-adoptions-if-court-overturns-roe-v-wade-11655990810"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whether to have children }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Women's reproductive lives look far different than they did in 1973, when the landmark decision established a constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/u-s-abortion-rate-ends-decadeslong-decline-11655262729"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rates of legal \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  soared }}}\uc2  before declining somewhat in recent years, access to contraception has increased and adoption rates have dropped. Groups on both sides acknowledge that many women have come {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/upholding-roe-v-wade-is-supported-by-most-americans-wsj-poll-finds-11654162200"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to see \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  as integral }}}\uc2  to the advances they have made in education and the workforce over the last five decades.\par \par \uc2 All of that is now in flux. About half the states in the country {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-courts-abortion-decision-sparks-immediate-action-from-states-11656096002"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are expected to ban all or most abortions }}}\uc2  immediately or shortly after the court decision, meaning the roughly 36 million women of childbearing age who live in those states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-abortion-is-legal-and-where-it-loses-protections-without-roe-v-wade-11656080346"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could soon or already have lost local \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  access }}}\uc2 . On Friday, more than half-a-dozen states including Missouri, Arkansas, South Dakota and Kentucky all said they had put into effect laws banning most abortions.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics in Wisconsin and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/state-abortion-restrictions-loom-some-officials-promise-not-to-enforce-them-11653235200"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 right-leaning states }}}\uc2  including Kentucky, Texas and West Virginia all said that they had to stop providing services on Friday, while clinics in more liberal areas and medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-providers-in-illinois-colorado-and-florida-prepare-for-patient-influx-if-roe-is-overturned-11655560800"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are bracing for a surge }}}\uc2  in demand. Groups that serve pregnant women are grappling with how to offer more aid on limited budgets.\par \par \uc2 Louis Monnig, an obstetrician-gynecologist in Louisville, Ky., where the state's trigger law banning most abortions took effect Friday, said his conversations with patients shifted in the weeks leading up to the Supreme Court's decision to let them know \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not be as accessible of an option soon. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
