urt decision. Angela Marchin, an obstetrician-gynecologist who provides abortions for Planned Parenthood, said doctors where she works have put up a map so they can visualize how far their patients have had to travel to get there. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
