\par\par \uc2 Commentary (U.S.)\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2 , Roe v Wade, and the Supreme Court: The Big Picture; In Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization, the justices have returned  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  policy to the states. Read the latest opinions from The Wall Street Journal.\b0\par\par\uc2 By WSJ Opinion Staff \par \uc2 1,140 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2022\par 23:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 's majority opinion in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization has overturned Roe v. Wade and Planned Parenthood v. Casey and returned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy to the states. The Opinion pages of The Wall Street Journal look at the history, facts and politics of the issue, and how the court's decision might affect the political landscape.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-goes-back-to-the-people-supreme-court-roe-v-wade-dobbs-v-jackson-samuel-alito-11656107148"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Goes Back to the People}}}\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court finally corrects its historic mistake.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-goes-back-to-the-people-supreme-court-roe-v-wade-dobbs-v-jackson-samuel-alito-11656107148"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-reclaims-legitimacy-abortion-roe-v-wade-dobbs-v-jackson-women-health-reproductive-rights-life-originalism-justice-alito-11656084197"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Supreme Court Reclaims Its Legitimacy}}}\par \par \uc2 In the 1973 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case, not today, the justices overstepped their boundaries and made their institution political.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-reclaims-legitimacy-abortion-roe-v-wade-dobbs-v-jackson-women-health-reproductive-rights-life-originalism-justice-alito-11656084197"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/roe-must-go-precedent-sake-abortion-pro-life-constitution-supreme-court-draft-alito-leak-loving-griswold-obergefell-11653338306"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Adam J. White: Roe v. Wade Must Go for Precedent's Sake}}}\par \par \uc2 For decades, every argument about Supreme Court precedent has been a proxy war over Roe v. Wade (1973). Anytime the justices questioned a precedent, their opinions were read as clues for the future of Roe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/roe-must-go-precedent-sake-abortion-pro-life-constitution-supreme-court-draft-alito-leak-loving-griswold-obergefell-11653338306"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-it-pro-life-means-march-for-pregnancy-centers-knights-of-columbus-abortion-roe-v-wade-11642712536"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Patrick E. Kelly: What It Means to Be Pro-Life}}}\par \par \uc2 Hundreds of thousands of pro-life advocates will gather in Washington on Friday for the annual March for Life. Every year it is one of the biggest demonstrations in the nation's capital, but some of the movement's most dedicated members won't be there. They'll be where they usually are, day in and day out\u8212\'20\'14at pregnancy resource centers caring for mothers and children, born and unborn.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/what-it-pro-life-means-march-for-pregnancy-centers-knights-of-columbus-abortion-roe-v-wade-11642712536"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/why-wont-the-left-talk-about-racial-disparities-in-abortion-low-income-marriage-pro-choice-11652218772"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jason L. Riley: Why Won't the Left Talk About Racial Disparities in \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 ?}}}\par \par \uc2 Bill Clinton's famous formulation in 1992 was that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ought to be "safe, legal and rare." His goal was to coalesce liberal and moderate Democrats on the issue, but the wording also suggested that even among supporters of Roe v. Wade, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was properly viewed as undesirable: the fewer, the better.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/why-wont-the-left-talk-about-racial-disparities-in-abortion-low-income-marriage-pro-choice-11652218772"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/chuck-schumers-radical-abortion-bill-senate-democrats-roe-v-wade-womens-health-protection-act-11652133702"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Editorial Board: Schumer's Radical \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Bill}}}\par \par \uc2 Protesters marched on the homes of conservative Supreme Court Justices over the weekend, an ugly attempt to scare them into saving Roe v. Wade. This week the drama moves to the Senate, where Democratic Leader \uc2 Chuck Schumer\uc2  plans a vote on a sweeping bill to override state laws and set a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/chuck-schumers-radical-abortion-bill-senate-democrats-roe-v-wade-womens-health-protection-act-11652133702"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/europe-abortion-law-roe-v-wade-supreme-court-european-union-leak-alito-dobbs-pro-life-choice-civil-womens-rights-11651757568"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Editorial Board: Europe's \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Lesson}}}\par \par \uc2 American progressives, and some on the right, have convinced themselves that legal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will disappear the moment the Supreme Court reverses its Roe v. Wade precedent. Since the Court is contemplating this, readers might appreciate examples from democracies that have grappled with this difficult issue without nine Justices to tell them what to do."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/europe-abortion-law-roe-v-wade-supreme-court-european-union-leak-alito-dobbs-pro-life-choice-civil-womens-rights-11651757568"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/did-supreme-court-nominees-lie-to-congress-neil-gorsuch-brett-kavanaugh-amy-coney-barrett-11651785479"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Editorial Board: Did Supreme Court Nominees Lie to Congress?}}}\par \par \uc2 One media narrative congealing after this week's Supreme Court leak is that President Trump's nominees lied to Congress by claiming they wouldn't overturn the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  precedent of Roe v. Wade. So allow us to check the tape\u8212\'20\'14and explain why respecting past decisions doesn't bind the Court to stand by serious constitutional errors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/did-supreme-court-nominees-lie-to-congress-neil-gorsuch-brett-kavanaugh-amy-coney-barrett-11651785479"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/justice-alitos-originalist-triumph-supreme-court-draft-opinion-constitution-abortion-roe-v-wade-justices-11651695865"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 David J. Garrow: Justice Alito's Originalist Triumph}}}\par \par \uc2 Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 's draft opinion in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization represents the auspicious culmination of the conservative legal movement, which has fundamentally transformed U.S. constitutional interpretation over the past quarter-century.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/justice-alitos-originalist-triumph-supreme-court-draft-opinion-constitution-abortion-roe-v-wade-justices-11651695865"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/the-end-of-roe-will-be-good-for-america-supreme-court-draft-leak-decision-abortion-pro-life-choice-justices-alito-11651787057"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Peggy Noonan: The End of Roe v. Wade Will Be Good for America}}}\par \par \uc2 Let's start with true anger and end with honest hope. The alarm many felt at the leaking of an entire draft Supreme Court decision shouldn't be allowed to dissipate as time passes. Such a thing has never happened. Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 's preliminary opinion being taken from the court, without permission or right, and given to the press was an act of sabotage by a vandal. It hardly matters whether the leaker was of the left or right. It reflected the same spirit as the Jan. 6 Capitol riot\u8212\'20\'14irresponsible destructiveness. As the book has been thrown at the rioters, it should be thrown at the leaker.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/the-end-of-roe-will-be-good-for-america-supreme-court-draft-leak-decision-abortion-pro-life-choice-justices-alito-11651787057"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/the-abortion-disinformation-campaign-roe-v-wade-samuel-alito-griswold-supreme-court-11651703428"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Editorial Board: The \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Disinformation Campaign}}}\par \par \uc2 First, they ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Next will be a contraception ban. Then a ban on same-sex and even interracial marriage. Soon we will all be living in "The Handmaid's Tale."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/the-abortion-disinformation-campaign-roe-v-wade-samuel-alito-griswold-supreme-court-11651703428"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/an-abortion-provider-and-a-pro-life-lawyer-found-common-ground-roe-v-wade-supreme-court-clinic-debate-women-children-11651591057"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Andy Puzder: An \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Provider and a Pro-Life Lawyer Found Common Ground}}}\par \par \uc2 As I sat in my office during the first week of 1990, my assistant informed me that an unexpected caller wanted to speak with me. A week earlier I had an opinion piece in the St. Louis Post-Dispatch proposing that people on both sides of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  debate could work together on issues affecting women and children\u8212\'20\'14without violating their core beliefs. As a start, I proposed support for legislation to aid impoverished women and their children.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/an-abortion-provider-and-a-pro-life-lawyer-found-common-ground-roe-v-wade-supreme-court-clinic-debate-women-children-11651591057"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-supreme-court-law-justices-roe-v-wade-11651269431?mod=latest_headlines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Letter to the Editor: \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  and the Power of the Supreme Court}}}\par \par \uc2 In 1966, during the pre-Roe v. Wade days, I wrote a term paper on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . At that time, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  proponents hurled arguments about back-alley abortions, undue burden, interstate travel to secure an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the disparity in availability.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-supreme-court-law-justices-roe-v-wade-11651269431?mod=latest_headlines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Letter}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-and-the-supreme-court-dobbs-v-jackson-mississippi-john-roberts-11651009292"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Editorial Board: \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  and the Supreme Court}}}\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court will soon decide an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case in which Mississippi has asked the Justices to overturn Roe v. Wade. The oral argument suggested that five Justices lean toward doing so, but a ferocious lobbying campaign is trying to change their minds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-and-the-supreme-court-dobbs-v-jackson-mississippi-john-roberts-11651009292"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Editorial}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/series/journal-editorial-report/wsj-opinion-the-supreme-court-gets-the-abortion-battle/8E05EFE5-24A2-43FA-A868-4A257F5D044F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Journal Editorial Report: The Supreme Court Gets the \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Battle}}}\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court hears arguments in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case. What we learned from the Mississippi oral arguments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/series/journal-editorial-report/wsj-opinion-the-supreme-court-gets-the-abortion-battle/8E05EFE5-24A2-43FA-A868-4A257F5D044F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Watch the Video}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-go-slow-roe-v-wade-abortion-precedents-gradualism-mississippi-dobbs-11638475763"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Richard M. Re: Good Reasons to Go Slow on \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Precedents}}}\par \par \uc2 Should the Supreme Court eliminate all constitutional \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights? That question dominated oral argument in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization on Wednesday. Opponents of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  have urged the court to overrule almost 50 years of precedents, including Roe v. Wade (1973) and Planned Parenthood v. Casey (1992).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-go-slow-roe-v-wade-abortion-precedents-gradualism-mississippi-dobbs-11638475763"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read the Article}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/series/journal-editorial-report/wsj-opinion-the-tense-politics-of-a-texas-abortion-law/91A72A37-CC11-4A43-845C-450113A9D71D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Journal Editorial Report: The Tense Politics of a Texas \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Law}}}\par \par \uc2 The Justice Department sues Texas over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law. Both the left and right want to politicize the courts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/video/series/journal-editorial-report/wsj-opinion-the-tense-politics-of-a-texas-abortion-law/91A72A37-CC11-4A43-845C-450113A9D71D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Watch the Video}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/podcasts/opinion-potomac-watch/the-supreme-court-leak-on-roe-v-wade/ec76529d-e91c-4827-9aa7-256367207add"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Supreme Court's Leak on Roe v. Wade}}}\par \par \uc2 A leaked draft opinion by Justice \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2  shows that the High Court might be preparing to strike down Roe v. Wade, which would return \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy to the states.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/podcasts/opinion-potomac-watch/the-supreme-court-leak-on-roe-v-wade/ec76529d-e91c-4827-9aa7-256367207add"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Listen to the Podcast}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/abortion-roe-v-wade-and-the-supreme-court-the-big-picture-11656111710"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 , Roe v 